sequenceDiagram
    participant K as 游戏命令
    participant D as MySQL
    participant L as 本域 ES
    participant Q as 本域 query API
    participant X as 外域
    participant P as projection
    participant W as corpus worker
    participant C as irisa_corpus

    K->>D: 事务：g_* + ledger + event_log
    K->>L: 提交后同步写读模型
    K->>X: 然后 emit
    X->>Q: 只调查询 API
    Q->>L: 本域自己读
    P->>W: 异步 CorpusDocument
    W->>C: embedding upsert
